    "body": "> Great Work! I have a few questions about the uploaded dataset：\n> \n> 1. In the Core4D_Real, what do the aligned_frame_ids.txt in the human_object_motions folder represent and when should it be used？Could you explain it in detail?\n> 2. In the  Updated CORE4D_Real_human_object_motions_v2, do the result.npz in a person folder represent the human motion data?\n>    Looking forward to your reply. Thanks!\n\nHi fengbihuoche,\n\n1. It is an intermediate file. Just ignore it.\n2. Yes. Each \"result.npz\" represents the motion of an individual person.",
